  "Tyrese Haliburton": "\"I feel great. Body feels great. I'm able to do everything,\" said Haliburton. \"I feel like I'm operating like I'm a healthy NBA player - for the first time in a long time, which is exciting.\" Haliburton missed the entire 2025-26 season after tearing his Achilles tendon seven minutes into Game 7 of the 2025 NBA Finals, but he's been participating in 5-on-5 work since April and no longer appears to have any restrictions. Still, it wouldn't be surprising if the Pacers managed his workload early in training camp and the preseason.",
